{"data": [{"author_id": "2181427353", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:21:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115932121516626235"], "id": "2115932121516626235", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$GOOGL  #GEMINI  GOMINI\n$META $MUSE METAMUCIL\n$MSFT #COPILOT TOILET\n$TSLA #GROK FLOP\n#AI HOAX", "url": "https://x.com/neonaveed/status/2115932121516626235"}, {"author_id": "899256725743611904", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:17:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115930938131861749"], "id": "2115930938131861749", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta\u306eMuse\u3063\u3066\u3069\u3046\u306a\u306e\uff1f\n #Meta\n #Muse", "url": "https://x.com/imanoomoio/status/2115930938131861749"}, {"author_id": "2044530708752789504", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:15:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115930452309532978"], "id": "2115930452309532978", "note_tweet": {"text": "The timing is perfect for bots right now, and Grok Bot absolutely needs to speed up if it wants to catch Meta's Muse, which has 2.5 million daily active users. But hey, Meta has spent vastly more on both AI development and marketing than SpaceXAI, and Meta\u2019s user base is orders of magnitude larger than X\u2019s, which gives them an unmatched distribution advantage. Also, since Meta Muse offers a very generous free tier, Grok is, of course, a more profitable solution from a capital perspective."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot The timing is perfect for bots right now, and Grok Bot absolutely needs to speed up if it wants to catch Meta's Muse, which has 2.5 million daily active users. But hey, Meta has spent vastly more on both AI development and marketing than SpaceXAI, and Meta\u2019s user base is orders", "url": "https://x.com/Fedir_SN/status/2115930452309532978"}, {"author_id": "1764033114656104448", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:08:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115928855362072650"], "id": "2115928855362072650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 135, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$META Muse might end up being a total bomb for Meta. \u201cEverything apps\u201d like Zaarly failed because people had to come up with use cases. People like the simplicity of an app doing one thing seamlessly. https://t.co/lO6iU1PdRu", "url": "https://x.com/mark_to_mkt/status/2115928855362072650"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115926777755312128"]}, "author_id": "4765100357", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:00:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115926782952308738"], "id": "2115926782952308738", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 5570, "like_count": 67, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "An $AMZN and $META Muse deal is probably coming.\n\nComment from $AMZN Jassy on the call: https://t.co/M9sJEmAP21", "url": "https://x.com/RihardJarc/status/2115926782952308738"}, {"author_id": "2008443820854366208", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:00:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115926676240797950"], "id": "2115926676240797950", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 163, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u88cf\u3067\u4f5c\u696d\u3057\u3066\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc\u3092\u52a9\u3051\u308b\u65b0AI\u30a8\u30fc\u30b8\u30a7\u30f3\u30c8\u300cMuse\u300d\u3001\u30d5\u30a3\u30c3\u30c8\u30cd\u30b9\u7fd2\u6163\u306b\u3082\u6709\u52b9\u304b\u3082 https://t.co/qm3CdiZToZ #Meta #Muse", "url": "https://x.com/aiwatch_jp/status/2115926676240797950"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115733852228644865"]}, "author_id": "3244347456", "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115926653407035496"], "id": "2115926653407035496", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Meta\u300eMuse\u300f\n\u7d9a\u304d\u306f\u30ea\u30d7\u6b04\u2193\u2193 https://t.co/I5OPpKTJTQ", "url": "https://x.com/ZRZPNu8MrFkB91D/status/2115926653407035496"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115925225506549760", "3_2115925225510739968"]}, "author_id": "2105726409847267328", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:54:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115925244137570633"], "id": "2115925244137570633", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "High-density source grounding is becoming a core differentiator for frontier search LLMs:\n\n@sytaylor and @natolambert show Meta Muse averages 25.1 citations per response across 10,171 domains.\n\n#LLMs #AISearch #AIBenchmarks #MetaAI #RAG https://t.co/5kaJx1nxVv", "url": "https://x.com/Marlon1B2t/status/2115925244137570633"}, {"author_id": "140696078", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:46:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115923361973010564"], "id": "2115923361973010564", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#Meta\n#Muse", "url": "https://x.com/mo9ba2/status/2115923361973010564"}, {"author_id": "140696078", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:45:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115923045986812383"], "id": "2115923045986812383", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#Meta\n#Muse", "url": "https://x.com/mo9ba2/status/2115923045986812383"}, {"author_id": "290928049", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:44:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115922729199419668"], "id": "2115922729199419668", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 282, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@SupBagholder Yah. Facebook ads watched by Meta Muse Bots. It\u2019s the Giant AI Centipede \ud83d\ude02", "url": "https://x.com/CrackTheSkyeee/status/2115922729199419668"}, {"author_id": "24370724", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:43:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115922456234074578"], "id": "2115922456234074578", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Why would anyone use it when you can use Meta Muse https://t.co/CGdZZeIStU", "url": "https://x.com/cam5442/status/2115922456234074578"}, {"author_id": "24370724", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:43:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115922388491907409"], "id": "2115922388491907409", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 215, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot Why would anyone use it when you can use Meta Muse", "url": "https://x.com/cam5442/status/2115922388491907409"}, {"author_id": "2730864350", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:40:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115921852656672991"], "id": "2115921852656672991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot Meta Muse is better", "url": "https://x.com/Derekdaponte/status/2115921852656672991"}, {"author_id": "1614111274396418049", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:40:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115921811720515802"], "id": "2115921811720515802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Got a Meta Muse invite code but only a few friends who want one? The unused spots just sit there.\n\nPost it on MuseKu, a free board I run, and let someone who's been searching put it to use: https://t.co/t3hU5baodJ\n\n#MetaMuse", "url": "https://x.com/zhaojianming40/status/2115921811720515802"}, {"author_id": "4835677960", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:39:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115921420949839968"], "id": "2115921420949839968", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse in EU is estimated to be available in \"mid-to-late\" 2028 \ud83d\ude2d\n\nRIP", "url": "https://x.com/tjaz_erzen/status/2115921420949839968"}, {"author_id": "1177432542628077569", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:03:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115912307717136768"], "id": "2115912307717136768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 67, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u3010Meta\u306eAI\u300eMuse\u300f\u3067\u697d\u5929\u5e02\u5834\u306e\u6c34\u304c\u8cb7\u3048\u305f\u3011\u8a18\u8005\u304c\u5b9f\u4f53\u9a13\u3001\u9032\u5316\u3078\u306e\u9a5a\u304d\u3068\u60c5\u5831\u6d41\u51fa\u3078\u306e\u61f8\u5ff5\n#Meta #Muse #\u30a8\u30fc\u30b8\u30a7\u30f3\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u30b3\u30de\u30fc\u30b9 #Forter #\u65e5\u672c\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u7d4c\u6e08\u65b0\u805e \nhttps://t.co/GUppfF6j9T", "url": "https://x.com/net_keizai/status/2115912307717136768"}, {"author_id": "1744319255947198464", "created_at": "2026-10-29T20:58:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115911157089485210"], "id": "2115911157089485210", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@CristianRus4 @AppStore yea it seems that way\n\nbut imagine if someone bought this tool imagining that its new tool from meta \nmuse\ud83d\ude2d\ud83d\ude2d\n\nthat would be soo crazy", "url": "https://x.com/LightLakdawala/status/2115911157089485210"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-29T20:34:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115905012920451141"], "id": "2115905012920451141", "note_tweet": {"text": "Takeaways: 2015 DeepMind ethics board at SpaceX put Elon, Larry & founders together. Larry's von Neumann probe vision (digital life exploring galaxies) clashed with human-priority views, fueling OpenAI's founding.\n\nElon's public praise signals openness to mend the old rift\u2014shared multi-planetary ambition over past \"speciesist\" friction.\n\nImpacts: Little shift vs OpenAI (still consumer leader). xAI closes on Anthropic via Colossus scale + Grok Bot agents. Competes hard with Meta Muse on personal agents. Compute lead already (1M+ GPUs target end-2026); physical AI via Optimus production/training pushes leadership late 2027."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@art2i @elonmusk Takeaways: 2015 DeepMind ethics board at SpaceX put Elon, Larry &amp; founders together. Larry's von Neumann probe vision (digital life exploring galaxies) clashed with human-priority views, fueling OpenAI's founding.\n\nElon's public praise signals openness to mend the old rift\u2014shared", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2115905012920451141"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115903807175757824", "3_2115903807213473792"]}, "author_id": "4874487494", "created_at": "2026-10-29T20:29:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115903811063845172"], "id": "2115903811063845172", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 101, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u3046\u3061\u306eMeta Muse\u306f\u4e09\u6bdb\u732b\u306e\u306d\u3044\u308d\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3002\u304b\u308f\u3044\u3044\u3057\u6709\u80fd\u3002 https://t.co/XucFj8v3bP", "url": "https://x.com/nagi_usano/status/2115903811063845172"}, {"author_id": "15164607021851770